# Normalise to LF in the repository. Without this, the CI step that rebuilds
# data/map.json and diffs it against the committed copy depends on every
# contributor's core.autocrlf agreeing with the runner's. scripts/build.py
# already writes newline="\n", so LF here makes the two match by rule rather
# than by coincidence.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
